Package: devjam-live-config
Version: 1.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: live-config
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Debian Live session settings by devjam
 Settings that only apply to a Debian Live session, through live-config:
 .
  - live-config component devjam-no-wallet: no password storage in the
    live session. KWallet is switched off (no first-use wizard, no Secret
    Service API) and GNOME Keyring can neither be started by systemd, by
    D-Bus activation nor by the GNOME/MATE autostart files. Everything is
    written to the live root, so an installed system keeps KWallet with
    its first-use wizard.
  - the groups of the live user (LIVE_USER_DEFAULT_GROUPS), including
    psychopy, psychtoolbox, dialout and lp for lab hardware.
